  "prefLabel": "Emp 404.06 Entity Match Requirement",
  "priorExpiration": "2020-06-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 404.06 Entity Match Requirement. The entity submitting an application for WorkInvestNH grant awards shall show that a minimum of 50% matching funds shall be paid by the entity towards the training.\n\nSource. #7765, eff 9-27-02; ss by #8989, eff 9-22-07, EXPIRES: 3-20-08 (from Emp 404.07); ss by #9092, eff 2-23-08, EXPIRED: 2-23-16\n\nNew. #12960, INTERIM, eff 12-26-19, EXPIRED: 6-23-20\n\nNew. #13074, eff 7-22-20",
